* Moriori heritage and Identity preservation<ref>{{Cite web |title=More Funding for the Treaty 2U exhibition {{!}} Beehive.govt.nz |url=https://www.beehive.govt.nz/release/more-funding-treaty-2u-exhibition |access-date=2024-03-12 |website=www.beehive.govt.nz |language=en}}</ref>
